# Local Recordings storage. Anchored to the repo root: an unanchored
# `recordings/` matches a directory of that name at ANY depth, which silently
# swallowed apps/web/src/app/admin/analytics/recordings/ — the page was written,
# `git add -A` skipped it, `git status` stayed clean, and the route 404'd in
# production because it never reached the repo.
/recordings/

